{"catalogue_version":"2026.09.16","hits":[{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/getting-started/glossary#link-token","id":"hiecm.glossary.link-token","summary":"The token that authorises your system to link a care context to a patient's ABHA address.","title":"Link token, the token that authorises linking","type":"glossary"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/errors#abdm-1026","id":"hiecm.error.abdm-1026","summary":"The link token you sent cannot authorise this link, so generate a new one rather than retrying.","title":"ABDM-1026, the link token is not valid","type":"error"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-callbacks/01-m2-post-v3-hip-token-on-generate-token#m2-on-generate-token-result","id":"hiecm.callback.m2-on-generate-token-result","summary":"The link token arrives here; store it against the patient, because it is valid for six months.","title":"The link token you asked for, or why it was refused","type":"callback"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-abdm-link-token-hip/01-m2-post-v3-token-generate-token#m2-generate-link-token","id":"hiecm.endpoint.m2-generate-link-token","summary":"Ask for a link token for one patient; it arrives on your bridge and is valid for six months.","title":"Generate Link Token","type":"endpoint"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-callbacks/01-m2-post-v3-hip-token-on-generate-token#m2-link-token-generation-call-back","id":"hiecm.callback.m2-link-token-generation-call-back","summary":"ABDM answers a link token request on the HIP's bridge, with the token or an error.","title":"Link token generation – Call Back API","type":"callback"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-abdm-hip-initiated-linking-hip/01-m2-post-hip-v3-link-carecontext#m2-hip-link-care-context","id":"hiecm.endpoint.m2-hip-link-care-context","summary":"The HIP links one or more care contexts to a patient's ABHA address, using the patient's link token.","title":"Link care contexts to an ABHA address","type":"endpoint"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/milestones/m2#m2-link-care-context","id":"hiecm.flow.m2-link-care-context","summary":"Tell ABDM that this patient had a visit at your facility so their records can be found and fetched later.","title":"Link a care context to a patient's ABHA","type":"flow"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-callbacks/07-m2-post-v3-hip-link-care-context-confirm#m2-on-link-confirm","id":"hiecm.callback.m2-on-link-confirm","summary":"ABDM posts the code the patient entered and the link reference number; the HIP checks them and answers on-confirm.","title":"Confirmation of a link, carrying the token the patient approved","type":"callback"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/errors#abdm-1063","id":"hiecm.error.abdm-1063","summary":"In linking the provider id does not match the link token, and in a consent flow the date range is not valid.","title":"ABDM-1063, HIP id mismatch, or an invalid date range","type":"error"},{"doc_url":"/docs/nhcx/v1/api/registry/endpoints/registry-v2-participant-link-abha-policy","id":"nhcx.endpoint.v2-participant-link-abha-policy","summary":"The second path for linking a beneficiary to the products they hold; it takes the same body as the main link call.","title":"POST /v2/participant/link/abha/policy","type":"endpoint"}]}
